  "details": "Similar to the idea of Avatar Culling, I'm mainly suggesting there to be a way where you can limit how Nameplates are shown.\n\nFollowing some examples like:\n\n*. Showing Full Nameplates within a user-set distance and Icon Nameplates outside that user-set distance.\n\n*. Choosing where either Full Nameplates, Icon Nameplates or Nameplates turned off as options between both distances.\n\n*. Limiting the number of name plates visible / closest to you.\n\nPretty much, this would function similar to how Avatar Culling functions, but for Nameplates. I'm not sure if there is already a suggestion similar to this or if this was already a planned feature of such, but I would honestly like to know if there is something like this or something similar coming up.",
